    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατα-φέρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carry down with</i> other things, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.994d
			</span></i>: —
				Pass.
			, <i>to be carried down together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				931b21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				357a17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
